msgid "VMware SVGA 同步与资源"
msgstr "VMware SVGA synchronization and resources"

msgid "提交和唤醒"
msgstr "Submission and wakeup"

msgid ""
"``drivers/video/svga/`` 实现 VMware FIFO/GB 协议； ``drivers/video/drm/vmwgfx/`` "
"负责 Linux vmwgfx ioctl 的验证、翻译与资源所有权。 公开 ioctl 编号和布局继续使用 "
"``include/uapi/drm/``，不新增私有加速协议。"
msgstr ""
"``drivers/video/svga/`` implements the VMware FIFO/GB protocol; "
"``drivers/video/drm/vmwgfx/`` handles validation, translation, and resource "
"ownership for Linux vmwgfx ioctls. Public ioctl numbers and layouts continue"
" to use ``include/uapi/drm/``, without a new private acceleration protocol."

msgid ""
"FIFO 命令、内联 PPN 数组与 fence 完整写入后，以内存屏障发布 NEXT_CMD。 支持 BUSY 寄存器的 host 在 BUSY "
"为真时承诺睡眠前检查新命令，因此只在 空闲到忙碌时写 BUSY 和 SYNC；不支持该寄存器的旧 FIFO 保留 SYNC 唤醒。 查询已经完成的 "
"fence 不重新唤醒 host。BUSY 仅表示处理活动，不能作为 命令完成或释放 DMA 页的依据。"
msgstr ""
"After FIFO commands, inline PPN arrays, and fences have been written in "
"full, NEXT_CMD is published with a memory barrier. Hosts supporting the BUSY"
" register promise to check for new commands before sleeping while BUSY is "
"true, so BUSY and SYNC are written only on the idle-to-busy transition; "
"older FIFOs without that register retain SYNC wakeups. Querying an already "
"completed fence does not wake the host again. BUSY indicates only processing"
" activity and cannot establish command completion or justify freeing DMA "
"pages."

msgid ""
"借用 BO 后备页时，GMR2 每个映射包含至多 256 个 PPN，每次调用发布至多 四个包，不逐包等待 host。最新 fence 按 FIFO "
"顺序覆盖所有已发布映射； 完成映射及最终 fence 之前，MOB ID 不可用于提交。FIFO 压力导致重试时 保留已发布的完整前缀。拆除仍须等待最终"
" unmap/destroy fence，之后才能 释放 owner 引用和物理页。"
msgstr ""
"When borrowing BO backing pages, each GMR2 mapping contains at most 256 "
"PPNs, and each call publishes at most four packets without waiting for the "
"host after each packet. The latest fence covers all published mappings in "
"FIFO order; the MOB ID cannot be used for submission until mapping and the "
"final fence complete. Retries under FIFO pressure retain the complete "
"published prefix. Teardown must still wait for the final unmap/destroy fence"
" before releasing owner references and physical pages."

msgid "损伤与呈现"
msgstr "Damage and presentation"

msgid ""
"Surface-backed KMS PRESENT 只编码一个固定协议包和尾随 fence，经 ``svga3d_present_try`` "
"原子发布；不为简单呈现分配通用 render-batch 的 shader/query/state 元数据。当前通用 sidecar 为 53008 "
"字节，需要 13 个 物理页；这些分配和清零不再出现在每次 KMS PRESENT 的路径中。"
msgstr ""
"Surface-backed KMS PRESENT encodes just one fixed protocol packet and a "
"trailing fence, published atomically through ``svga3d_present_try``; it does"
" not allocate generic render-batch shader/query/state metadata for simple "
"presentation. The current generic sidecar is 53008 bytes and requires 13 "
"physical pages; those allocations and zeroing no longer occur on every KMS "
"PRESENT path."

msgid ""
"该接口在同一个 SVGA 锁临界区检查设备、完整 surface handle、源/目标矩形 范围和 FIFO 容量。发布成功才更新 surface 的"
" last-use fence；FIFO 忙时 不发布部分命令，也不假定绘制完成。呈现 job 继续持有 framebuffer 和 surface "
"引用，直到真实 fence 完成或有明确 quiescence 证据，不能因关闭文件、释放 master 或切换 VT 就提前释放 DMA 后备页。"
msgstr ""
"The interface checks the device, full surface handle, source/destination "
"rectangle bounds, and FIFO capacity within a single SVGA-lock critical "
"section. It updates the surface's last-use fence only after successful "
"publication; a busy FIFO neither publishes partial commands nor implies "
"rendering completion. Presentation jobs continue to hold framebuffer and "
"surface references until the actual fence completes or explicit quiescence "
"evidence exists. Closing a file, releasing master, or switching VT must not "
"prematurely free DMA backing pages."

msgid ""
"正常 DIRTYFB 仍立即尝试提交，只有背压才保留脏区域并合并重试，不按定时器 延迟成功提交。Linux UAPI 的 256 个 clip "
"上限不变。Xorg modesetting 在超出 上限时可能退回逐个 clip 提交，因此简单呈现的分配开销会被放大；离屏绘制 "
"不经过这条扫描输出路径，不能用离屏速度代替桌面呈现速度。"
msgstr ""
"Normal DIRTYFB still attempts immediate submission; only backpressure "
"retains dirty regions and coalesces retries, without timer-delaying "
"successful submissions. The Linux UAPI limit of 256 clips is unchanged. Xorg"
" modesetting may fall back to individual clip submissions when exceeding "
"that limit, amplifying the allocation overhead of simple presentation. "
"Offscreen drawing does not pass through this scanout path, so offscreen "
"speed cannot stand in for desktop presentation speed."

msgid ""
"软件扫描输出后备路径按行以精确的 32 位像素上传到四字节对齐的显存， 使用 ``REP MOVSL``，避免把针对普通 RAM 的 ``REP "
"MOVSB`` 用于 uncached 设备窗口。非原生格式仍先执行原有颜色转换；非四字节像素保留逐字节路径。 "
"上传不读取显存，不访问行尾填充或单次上传矩形外的像素，不使用用户 SIMD 状态。 软件 DIRTYFB 先校验全部 "
"clip；多块损伤的面积之和小于包围矩形时分别上传， 避免光标和远处窗口的一点变化触发整片屏幕复制。重叠面积使逐块复制更大时 "
"仍上传包围矩形，复制量不超过旧路径。设备 surface 的异步呈现仍沿用原有合并。 损伤保留、FIFO 背压、fence 和 VT 所有权规则不变。 "
"该路径降低 CPU 上传成本，不代表 QEMU 提供了 VMware 3D 加速能力。"
msgstr ""
"The software scanout fallback uploads exact 32-bit pixels row by row to "
"four-byte-aligned video memory using ``REP MOVSL``, avoiding ``REP MOVSB`` "
"optimized for ordinary RAM on an uncached device window. Non-native formats "
"still undergo the existing color conversion first; non-four-byte pixels "
"retain the bytewise path. Uploads do not read video memory, touch row-end "
"padding or pixels outside the individual upload rectangle, or use userspace "
"SIMD state. Software DIRTYFB validates all clips first; when the sum of "
"separate damage areas is smaller than the bounding rectangle, they are "
"uploaded separately to avoid copying a large screen area for a cursor change"
" and a small change in a distant window. When overlapping areas make "
"separate copying larger, the bounding rectangle is still uploaded, so copy "
"volume does not exceed the old path. Asynchronous presentation of device "
"surfaces retains existing coalescing. Damage retention, FIFO backpressure, "
"fences, and VT ownership rules remain unchanged. This path reduces CPU "
"upload cost and does not mean QEMU provides VMware 3D acceleration."

msgid "像素缓存属性"
msgstr "Pixel cache attributes"

msgid ""
"启动 BSP 在稀疏直映射完成、用户页表与 AP 启动之前，为支持 PAT 且启用 MTRR 的 CPU 保留 PAT 槽四作为 "
"WC；其他固件项保持原样。只有可预取 PCI BAR1 与实际 SVGA 像素窗口吻合、完整 UC 永久保留且没有租约/其他缓存 别名、没有普通 RAM"
" 或 FIFO 交叠时，才一次性转换为 WC/NX。失败保留 UC。 首次尝试或创建用户页表后关闭重设入口，不在运行中的映射下更改缓存类型。"
msgstr ""
"During boot, after the sparse direct map is complete and before user page "
"tables and AP startup, the BSP reserves PAT slot four as WC on CPUs "
"supporting PAT with MTRR enabled; other firmware entries remain unchanged. A"
" one-time conversion to WC/NX occurs only if prefetchable PCI BAR1 matches "
"the actual SVGA pixel window, the complete UC range is permanently reserved,"
" there are no leases or other cache aliases, and there is no overlap with "
"ordinary RAM or FIFO. Failure preserves UC. The reconfiguration entry point "
"closes after the first attempt or creation of user page tables; cache types "
"are not changed underneath running mappings."

msgid ""
"直映射和保留的低地址别名一起更新，缓存与 TLB 在转换前后清理；AP 在 上线前验证并安装相同 PAT 布局，无法满足的 AP "
"保持离线。fbdev/DEVICE 映射沿用同一物理页的缓存选择器，模式切换和 SVGA 3D 初始化保留该策略。 "
"像素写入在提交损伤之前执行内存屏障，即使 FIFO 满而延后发布也先排空 WC 写入。FIFO 继续采用其原有的独立验证策略，控制寄存器不使用 WC。"
msgstr ""
"The direct map and retained low-address aliases are updated together, with "
"caches and TLBs cleaned before and after conversion. APs validate and "
"install the same PAT layout before coming online; APs unable to meet it "
"remain offline. fbdev/DEVICE mappings use the same cache selector for the "
"same physical page, and mode switches and SVGA 3D initialization preserve "
"this policy. Pixel writes execute a memory barrier before damage submission,"
" draining WC writes even when publication is delayed by a full FIFO. The "
"FIFO retains its separate existing validation policy, and control registers "
"do not use WC."

msgid ""
"``nopat`` 启动参数保留原来的 UC 像素路径。这里的内部映射 API 不向用户 提供任意缓存属性修改权限；物理范围的缓存别名约束参考 "
"`Linux PAT 文档 <https://docs.kernel.org/arch/x86/pat.html>`_。"
msgstr ""
"The ``nopat`` boot parameter preserves the original UC pixel path. The "
"internal mapping API here does not give users arbitrary cache-attribute "
"modification rights; see `Linux PAT documentation "
"<https://docs.kernel.org/arch/x86/pat.html>`_ for physical-range cache-alias"
" constraints."

msgid "EXECBUF 背压"
msgstr "EXECBUF backpressure"

msgid ""
"在途工作受 32 个任务和 8 MiB 的全局预算约束。预算暂满时，先在释放 exec_lock 后执行一次有界回收，再原子重试预留；仍未腾出空间则返回"
" EBUSY。 不会扩大限额、循环持锁等待 host，也不会跳过尚未完成的 fence 来释放内存。 单次申请本身超过限额或真实 heap "
"分配失败仍返回 ENOMEM，并回滚预留计数。"
msgstr ""
"In-flight work is limited by a global budget of 32 jobs and 8 MiB. When the "
"budget is temporarily full, exec_lock is released before one bounded "
"reclamation pass, followed by an atomic reservation retry; if no space is "
"available, EBUSY is returned. Limits are not expanded, locks are not held in"
" a loop waiting for the host, and incomplete fences are not skipped to free "
"memory. A single request exceeding the limit or a real heap-allocation "
"failure still returns ENOMEM and rolls back reservation counts."

msgid ""
"Mesa 的 vmwgfx winsys 对 EXECBUF EBUSY 会短暂休眠后重试，其他错误可能使 Xorg/glamor "
"终止。把暂时的队列拥塞当作 ENOMEM 会在 GPU 落后于提交时导致 桌面退出，即使实际预算占用远低于物理内存容量。该行为参考 `Mesa 上游的 "
"EBUSY 重试修复 "
"<https://fuchsia.googlesource.com/third_party/mesa/+/20b78393920f138f6f521251df7f98768706089e%5E%21/>`_；"
" 不修改 ioctl 编号或结构，也不把真实分配失败伪装成成功。"
msgstr ""
"Mesa's vmwgfx winsys briefly sleeps and retries EXECBUF EBUSY, while other "
"errors may terminate Xorg/glamor. Treating temporary queue congestion as "
"ENOMEM can cause the desktop to exit when the GPU falls behind submissions, "
"even with budget usage far below physical memory capacity. This behavior "
"follows the `upstream Mesa EBUSY retry fix "
"<https://fuchsia.googlesource.com/third_party/mesa/+/20b78393920f138f6f521251df7f98768706089e%5E%21/>`_;"
" it changes neither ioctl numbers nor structures and does not disguise real "
"allocation failures as success."

msgid "分配与锁"
msgstr "Allocation and locks"

msgid ""
"内部 ``svga_ops.alloc`` 返回独占、页对齐且已经清零的物理页；失败返回零。 生产实现使用 ``mm_alloc_pages``。GB "
"后备页和 shader staging 不重复清零。 页表中尚未写入的项和 shader 尾部填充仍由分配器的零页保证覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Internal ``svga_ops.alloc`` returns exclusively owned, page-aligned, already"
" zeroed physical pages, or zero on failure. The production implementation "
"uses ``mm_alloc_pages``. GB backing pages and shader staging are not zeroed "
"twice. Unwritten page-table entries and shader-tail padding remain covered "
"by the allocator's zeroed pages."

msgid ""
"物理页分配器在 mm_lock 内认领完整页段、初始化引用并更新空闲计数，随后 解锁再清零，返回前不会向调用方发布物理地址。其他 CPU "
"不能分配已经认领 但仍在清零的页面。调用方已有的锁和 IRQ 状态保持原样；这不意味着所有 SVGA "
"资源分配都可抢占，也不能据此声称所有整机停顿已经消除。"
msgstr ""
"The physical-page allocator claims the entire page run, initializes "
"references, and updates the free count within mm_lock, then unlocks before "
"zeroing; no physical address is published to the caller before return. Other"
" CPUs cannot allocate pages already claimed but still being zeroed. The "
"caller's existing locks and IRQ state remain unchanged; this does not mean "
"all SVGA resource allocation is preemptible or establish that all whole-"
"system stalls are eliminated."

msgid "SYNCCPU 兼容语义"
msgstr "SYNCCPU compatibility semantics"

msgid ""
"Linux v6.12 的 ``drm_vmw_synccpu_allow_cs`` grab 等待先前 GPU 使用完成， 但不建立阻止后续命令提交的"
" CPU writer reservation。对应 release 对有效 handle 成功返回，不递减其他非 ALLOW_CS grab "
"的计数；无效 handle 和非法 flag 仍返回 EINVAL。非 ALLOW_CS grab 保留原来的 writer 排斥与关闭清理。"
msgstr ""
"Linux v6.12 ``drm_vmw_synccpu_allow_cs`` grab waits for prior GPU use to "
"complete but does not establish a CPU writer reservation blocking later "
"command submissions. The corresponding release succeeds for a valid handle "
"without decrementing counts of other non-ALLOW_CS grabs; invalid handles and"
" invalid flags still return EINVAL. Non-ALLOW_CS grabs retain the original "
"writer exclusion and close cleanup."

msgid ""
"行为参考 `Linux v6.12 vmwgfx BO 接口 "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.12/drivers/gpu/drm/vmwgfx/vmwgfx_bo.c>`_；"
" 此处按上游接口语义实现，不复制 Linux vmwgfx 实现代码。 协议头的原有许可证与归属说明保留；本次实现没有导入其他内核的 DRM 源码。"
msgstr ""
"Behavior follows the `Linux v6.12 vmwgfx BO interface "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.12/drivers/gpu/drm/vmwgfx/vmwgfx_bo.c>`_;"
" the upstream interface semantics are implemented without copying Linux "
"vmwgfx implementation code. Existing licenses and attribution in protocol "
"headers are preserved; this implementation imports no DRM source code from "
"other kernels."

msgid "验证边界"
msgstr "Validation boundaries"

msgid ""
"宿主 fixture 需要覆盖旧 FIFO 唤醒、BUSY 状态、已完成 fence、未完成映射、 背压和拆除时的 owner 生命周期，并使用 "
"ASan/UBSan 检查生产实现。 真实 VMware 验证还需检查 Xorg 日志确实启用 SVGA3D/glamor、正确像素、 "
"重复会话、资源反复创建/销毁和并发负载。QEMU 的 VMware 型号设备不能替代 真实 VMware 3D 验证。未复现某次 panic "
"不等于已经证明其原因或修复。"
msgstr ""
"Host fixtures must cover older FIFO wakeups, BUSY state, completed fences, "
"incomplete mappings, backpressure, and owner lifecycles during teardown, "
"checking the production implementation with ASan/UBSan. Real VMware "
"validation must also verify that Xorg logs actually show SVGA3D/glamor "
"enabled, correct pixels, repeated sessions, repeated resource "
"creation/destruction, and concurrent loads. QEMU's VMware-model device "
"cannot replace real VMware 3D validation. Failure to reproduce a particular "
"panic does not prove its cause or fix."

msgid "资源预算"
msgstr "Resource budgets"

msgid ""
"GB 对象使用本驱动的有界页预算，初值来自设备报告的内存寄存器：支持 ``CAP2.GB_MEMSIZE_2`` 时使用 "
"``GBOBJECT_MEM_SIZE_KB``，否则使用 ``SUGGESTED_GBOBJECT_MEM_SIZE_KB``。这与 Linux "
"vmwgfx 对相同硬件接口的 选择一致。这是来宾分配策略；Linux vmwgfx 将对应容量视为可扩大的软上限， "
"不能据此声称硬件必然拒绝超出该值的对象。旧 GMR 的后备预算不截断 GB 内存；单个 MOB 仍受 ``MOB_MAX_SIZE``、32 "
"位线协议长度和 PPN32 两级页表容量约束。 字节数向上取整为页数时使用 64 位中间值，避免 ``UINT32_MAX`` 回绕。"
msgstr ""
"GB objects use this driver's bounded page budget, initially derived from "
"device-reported memory registers: ``GBOBJECT_MEM_SIZE_KB`` when "
"``CAP2.GB_MEMSIZE_2`` is supported, otherwise "
"``SUGGESTED_GBOBJECT_MEM_SIZE_KB``. This matches Linux vmwgfx's selection "
"for the same hardware interface. It is a guest allocation policy; Linux "
"vmwgfx treats the corresponding capacity as an expandable soft limit, so it "
"does not establish that hardware necessarily rejects objects exceeding that "
"value. The legacy GMR backing budget does not truncate GB memory; each MOB "
"remains constrained by ``MOB_MAX_SIZE``, 32-bit wire-protocol lengths, and "
"PPN32 two-level page-table capacity. Rounding bytes up to pages uses 64-bit "
"intermediate values to avoid ``UINT32_MAX`` wraparound."

msgid ""
"GMR2 的注册页数独立受 ``GMRS_MAX_PAGES`` 限制。自有与借用的 GMR 共享此 "
"注册预算；已经发布但尚在映射或退休的对象，在最终解除之前仍计费。 GB 预算包含自有物理页、借用 MOB 的完整后备页、页表和尚未提交的 shader "
"预留。批处理 shader 与普通 MOB 分配使用相同的预算检查。借用后备页 直到最终拆除 fence 完成才解除计费，但这些页始终由调用方 "
"owner 释放。 自有物理页和页表还受分配器实际可用内存约束；分配失败 仍返回 ``ENOMEM``，不会通过关闭加速或吞掉错误隐藏失败。"
msgstr ""
"Registered GMR2 pages are independently limited by ``GMRS_MAX_PAGES``. Owned"
" and borrowed GMRs share this registration budget; published objects still "
"being mapped or retired remain charged until final unmapping. The GB budget "
"includes owned physical pages, complete backing pages for borrowed MOBs, "
"page tables, and uncommitted shader reservations. Batch shaders and ordinary"
" MOB allocations use the same budget checks. Borrowed backing pages remain "
"charged until the final teardown fence completes, but they are always freed "
"by the caller's owner. Owned physical pages and page tables are also "
"constrained by memory actually available from the allocator; allocation "
"failures still return ``ENOMEM``, without hiding failures by disabling "
"acceleration or swallowing errors."

msgid ""
"表面 ID 存储支持协议规定的 32768 项，并接受设备更低的 ``MAX_SURFACE_IDS`` "
"上限；零号保留。对象表按协商后的容量分配，并进一步 受单个 MOB 可容纳的表项数限制；context、surface、shader 和外部 MOB 的"
" 编号范围保持互不重叠。surface 快照使用在发布和最终释放时更新的计数， 仍包含正在创建或退休的句柄，避免每次提交都持锁扫描全部 32768 项。"
" 资源句柄、代际验证、fence 退休与 模块 owner 生命周期规则保持不变。非 GB 设备继续使用既有的后备内存策略。"
msgstr ""
"Surface ID storage supports the protocol's 32768 entries and honors lower "
"device ``MAX_SURFACE_IDS`` limits; ID zero is reserved. Object tables are "
"allocated at the negotiated capacity and further limited by the number of "
"entries a single MOB can hold; ID ranges for contexts, surfaces, shaders, "
"and external MOBs remain disjoint. Surface snapshots use counts updated at "
"publication and final release and still include handles being created or "
"retired, avoiding a locked scan of all 32768 entries on every submission. "
"Resource handles, generation validation, fence retirement, and module owner "
"lifecycle rules remain unchanged. Non-GB devices continue to use the "
"existing backing-memory policy."

msgid ""
"对应上游接口见 `Linux v6.12 vmwgfx 初始化 "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.12/drivers/gpu/drm/vmwgfx/vmwgfx_drv.c>`_"
" 和 `SVGA 寄存器定义 "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.12/drivers/gpu/drm/vmwgfx/device_include/svga_reg.h>`_。"
" 预算策略对照见 `Linux v6.12 vmwgfx 内存管理器 "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.12/drivers/gpu/drm/vmwgfx/vmwgfx_gmrid_manager.c>`_。"
msgstr ""
"For the corresponding upstream interfaces, see `Linux v6.12 vmwgfx "
"initialization "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.12/drivers/gpu/drm/vmwgfx/vmwgfx_drv.c>`_"
" and `SVGA register definitions "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.12/drivers/gpu/drm/vmwgfx/device_include/svga_reg.h>`_."
" For a budget-policy comparison, see the `Linux v6.12 vmwgfx memory manager "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.12/drivers/gpu/drm/vmwgfx/vmwgfx_gmrid_manager.c>`_."
